    "text": "Menn \u00f0a leofestan, \u00feis syndon halige dagas & halwendlice & urum sawlum l\u00e6cedomlice, & us\n& uton l\u00e6tan ure idelan spr\u00e6ca, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge \u00feonne we ut gangen mid \u00feam haligdome ge \u00feonne we in\n& \u00feonne we \u00fe\u00e6rinne beo\u00f0, butan tweon gif we elles hw\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6rinne do\u00f0 butan \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t us beboden\nSelre bi\u00f0 urum gehwylcum \u00fe\u00e6t we na on cyrecan ne cumen \u00feonne we cumen, gyf we \u00fe\u00e6rinne\nWe r\u00e6ddon on haligum bocum \u00fe\u00e6t sum w\u00e6s m\u00e6re wer on eor\u00f0an se w\u00e6s Godes witiga \u00feam w\u00e6s\nBe \u00f0am ys awriten on haligum bocum \u00fe\u00e6t he ab\u00e6d \u00e6t Gode for \u00fe\u00e6s folces geleafleste \u00fee he mid\n& sona swa he eft geseah & ongeat \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fe\u00e6t folc to Gode cyrde, he eft hr\u00e6dlice \u00e6t Gode ab\u00e6d \u00fe\u00e6t\nUton us nu ealle \u00fee geornor warnian, & forl\u00e6tan urne gedwolan & unriht h\u00e6medo & \u00e6r\u00e6tas &\nAc utan symle of eallum \u00feam godum \u00fee us God her on worulde l\u00e6ne hym \u00fea teo\u00f0unga don\n& utan georne of \u00f0am nigon d\u00e6lum Godes \u00feearfum \u00e6lmessan d\u00e6lan, for \u00fean seo \u00e6lmessylen alyst\nF\u00e6sten & \u00e6lmessylen sceolon \u00e6ghwylcum cristinum menn \u00e6tg\u00e6dere fyligean, for \u00f0am \u00fe\u00e6t f\u00e6sten\n\u00deurh \u00fe\u00e6t beo\u00f0 leahtras afyllede, & \u00fe\u00e6t fl\u00e6sc by\u00f0 geeadmett, & \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t beo\u00f0 deofles costunga\n& seo \u00e6lmessylen ys gefyllednes & fulfremednes eallra goda, & heo ys halig \u00feing, & heo geyc\u00f0\n\u00dereo cynn syndon \u00e6lmesd\u00e6da.\nAn is lichomlic, \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00feam w\u00e6dliendan to gode sylle swa hw\u00e6t swa man m\u00e6ge.\nO\u00f0er is gastlic, \u00fe\u00e6t man forgife \u00feam \u00fee o\u00f0erum \u00e6nig yfel de\u00f0 eall \u00fe\u00e6t he him to wite.\n\u00deridde is \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00fea dweliendan on so\u00f0f\u00e6stnesse weg gel\u00e6dde.\nUtan nu, men \u00fea leofestan, georne \u00e6g\u00f0er began \u00e6tg\u00e6dere, ge f\u00e6stenu ge \u00e6lmysd\u00e6da, & uton us\nSe forma heafodleahtor ys ofermodignes, seo ys gecweden cwen eallra yfela.\n\u00deurh \u00f0a feollon englas of heofonum on helle & to deoflum gewurdon.\n& heo ys gecweden angin \u00e6lcere synne, seo by\u00f0 oft upp asprungen of furhogunge Godes beboda.\n& \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t mod by\u00f0 upp ahafen be godum wurcum, \u00feonne se mann wen\u00f0 & tele\u00f0 hyne sylfne\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re by\u00f0 so\u00f0lice acenned \u00e6lc unhyrsumnes & ge\u00feristl\u00e6cung & geflit & gedwyld & gylp &\nAc \u00feas m\u00e6g seo so\u00f0e eadmodnes ealle oferswi\u00f0an.\n\u00deonne ys se o\u00f0er heafodleahter gecweden gifernes, seo ys ungemetigende gewilnung \u00e6g\u00f0er ge\n\u00deurh \u00fea, \u00fea forman magas mennesces cynnes forspildon heofona rices ges\u00e6lignesse & wurdon\nSeo by\u00f0 gesewen \u00ferym gemetum on \u00feam menn rixiende, \u00fe\u00e6t ys \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6t se man wile \u00e6r rihtre\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re bi\u00f0 acenned ungescead bliss & sceandlicnes & leohtbr\u00e6dnes & idel spr\u00e6c & lichoman\n& \u00feonne m\u00e6g seo beon selest oferswi\u00f0ed \u00feurh f\u00e6steno & \u00feurh forh\u00e6fednesse.\n\u00d0onne ys se \u00feridda heafodleahter gecweden forlyr, \u00fe\u00e6t ys eall lichamlic uncl\u00e6nnes.\nOf \u00f0am bi\u00f0 acenned modes blindnes & eagena unsta\u00f0ulf\u00e6stnes & idelne plegan & wr\u00e6nnes &\n\u00de\u00e6t by\u00f0 \u00f0eahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere oferswi\u00f0ed \u00feurh so\u00f0e lufe & \u00feurh gehealdsumnesse & \u00feurh gemynd \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00deonne ys se feor\u00f0a heafodleahtor gecweden gytsung, seo is swi\u00f0lic gr\u00e6dignes, \u00e6g\u00f0er ge welan to\nEall swa w\u00e6terseoc mann \u00feam wyxt to geiht \u00feurst \u00fe\u00e6s \u00f0e swi\u00f0or \u00fee he swi\u00f0or drinc\u00f0, swa by\u00f0 se\n\u00de\u00e6re gytsunge cynnreno syndon anda & stala & scea\u00f0unga & mannslihtas & leasunga &\nSeo by\u00f0 so\u00f0lice oferswi\u00f0ed \u00feurh Godes ege & \u00feurh bro\u00f0era so\u00f0e lufe & \u00feurh mildheortnesse\n\u00deonne ys se fifta heafodleahter gecweden yrre, \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t ne m\u00e6g nan mann habban\nOf \u00f0am sprytt modes to\u00f0undennes & saca & teonan & \u00e6bylg\u00f0 & yfelsacung & blodes agotenes &\n\u00de\u00e6t by\u00f0 so\u00f0lice oferswi\u00f0ed \u00feurh ge\u00f0yld & \u00feurh \u00feolomodnesse & \u00feurh andgytlic gescead \u00f0e God\n\u00deonne ys se syxta heafodleahtor gecweden sleacnes, seo dera\u00f0 \u00feearle foroft \u00feam \u00fee Gode\n\u00deis is se leahtor \u00fee swi\u00f0ost munecas ut anytt of hyra mynstrum on worulde & hie ut awyrp\u00f0 of\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re by\u00f0 acenned slapolnes & sleacnes godes weorces & unsta\u00f0olf\u00e6stnes stowe & worung of\nSeo by\u00f0 \u00feeahhw\u00e6\u00f0ere oferswi\u00f0ed \u00feurh \u00feone bigang \u00fe\u00e6re r\u00e6dinge & \u00f0urh \u00fea singalnesse \u00fe\u00e6s\n\u00feonne ys se seofe\u00f0a heafodleahter gecweden unrotnes.\n\u00deonne syndon so\u00f0lice twa cynnryno unrotnesse, an halwendlic & o\u00f0er cwylmberendlic.\n\u00d0onne witodlice is seo unrotnes halwendlic \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6s synnfullan mannes mod by\u00f0 geunrotsud\n\u00d0onne is o\u00f0er, men \u00f0a leofestan, \u00f0ysse worulde unrotnes, seo gewyrc\u00f0 dea\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6re sawle, & heo\nOf \u00fe\u00e6re by\u00f0 so\u00f0lice acened yfelnes & modes angsumnes & wacmodnes & byternes, on \u00fe\u00e6re ne\nSeo by\u00f0 so\u00f0lice oferswi\u00f0ed of gastlicre blisse & of hyhte \u00fe\u00e6ra toweardra goda & of haligra\n\u00d0onne ys se eahto\u00f0a heafodleahter gecweden idel wuldor.\n\u00de\u00e6t is witodlice idel to wuldrigenne \u00feonne se mann gegyrn\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t he beo hered on his godum &\n\u00d0onne so\u00f0lice of \u00f0yses leahtres wyrttruman by\u00f0 acenned boiung & gylp & \u00e6byl\u00f0 &\n\u00feonne ys \u00fe\u00e6re adle l\u00e6cedom gemynd \u00fe\u00e6re godcundan godnesse, \u00feurh \u00f0a us synt ealle god\nOn \u00fe\u00e6s lofe we sceolon don swa hw\u00e6t swa we on \u00feisse worulde wyrca\u00f0, & ma we sceolon\n\u00d0is syndon, men \u00f0a leofestan, \u00fea ehta heafodleahtras mid heora herium \u00fee d\u00e6ghwamlice ongean\n& hi synd swi\u00f0e strange deofles cempen ongean mennisc cynn, \u00fea beo\u00f0 ea\u00f0elice, Gode\n\u00c6rest so\u00f0lice seo ofermodignys by\u00f0 oferswi\u00feed \u00feurh eadmodnysse, & seo gyfernyss by\u00f0\n\u00deonne is \u00e6rest witodlice \u00e6lcum menn georne to secenne & to smeagenne hw\u00e6t si \u00fe\u00e6s modes\n\u00de\u00e6s modes m\u00e6gen is se gegyrla \u00fe\u00e6s gecyndes & seo arf\u00e6stnys \u00fe\u00e6s lifes & \u00fe\u00e6t gescead \u00fe\u00e6ra\n\u00deis syndon \u00fea m\u00e6genu \u00fe\u00e6s modes.\n\u00deonne syndon \u00fea fyrmestan m\u00e6genu & \u00fea healicestan d\u00e6las \u00fe\u00e6re ecan eadignysse, snoternys &\n\u00deonne is seo snoternys gecweden ingehyd, swa swa hit mannum geseald is \u00e6g\u00f0er ge godcundra\n\u00deonne is seo rihtwisnys gecweden \u00fe\u00e6s modes \u00e6\u00f0elnys, on \u00fe\u00e6re by\u00f0 gehealden se biggeng \u00fe\u00e6re\n\u00deonne is seo streng\u00f0 micel miht \u00fe\u00e6s modes & langsumnys & \u00feurhwunung on godum weorcum &\n\u00deonne is seo gemetegung ealles \u00fe\u00e6s lifes gemet, \u00fee l\u00e6s \u00fee \u00e6nig man to \u00feearle hw\u00e6t lufige o\u00f0\u00f0e\nAnd witodlice nis nan snoternyss betere \u00feonne seo \u00fee God bi\u00f0 on agiten \u00e6fter mennisces modes\nHw\u00e6t is us rihtwislicre \u00feonne we God lufion & his bebodu gehealdon - \u00feurh \u00feone, \u00fea we n\u00e6ron,\nHw\u00e6t is us b\u00e6tere toforan \u00e6lcere middangeardlicre streng\u00f0e \u00feonne we oferswi\u00feon helle deofla &\nIs us, men \u00f0a leofestan, micclum to forewarnigenne & to gymenne \u00feeah us wel \u00feyses earman\nUton ge\u00feencan \u00fe\u00e6t we nan \u00fe\u00e6ra \u00feinga \u00fee us on \u00feisse worulde forwel lica\u00f0 heonon of \u00feisum life\nUton us nu \u00f0a warnian, men \u00f0a leofestan, wi\u00f0 ealle \u00feas foresprecenan word geornlice, & habban\nHie him on helle togenes beo\u00f0 geearwode & \u00fe\u00e6r \u00feonne \u00e6fre on ecnesse witu \u00feolia\u00f0.\nHwig nelle we, nu we ea\u00f0e magon & us God \u00feone fyrst her on worulde forl\u00e6ten h\u00e6f\u00f0, Godes\n\u00de\u00e6r ys ece med & \u00fe\u00e6r ys lif butan dea\u00f0e & \u00fe\u00e6r ys gefea butan unrotnesse & \u00fe\u00e6r is leoht butan",
